  Slug: hermit
  DisplayName: Hermit
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: "In an isolated place\u2014like a cave, remote oasis, or secluded
    mansion\u2014you lived a life of solitude. Adventuring might be a welcome reprieve
    from solitude or an unwanted change, but in either case, you're likely still
    rough around the edges. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution
    or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Nature
    or Occultism skill, plus a Lore skill related to the terrain you lived in as
    a hermit (such as Cave Lore or Desert Lore). You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Dubious
    Knowledge] skill feat."
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Player Core
